OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FBright with sunny spells and a
OL,6,Ffew mostly light showers, the best of
OL,7,Fthe brightness first thing and again
OL,8,Fin the late afternoon. Breezy to start
OL,9,Fbut winds becoming light through the
OL,10,Fday.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FMostly dry with some bright
OL,13,Fspells at first but patchy rain soon
OL,14,Fspreading north through the evening,
OL,15,Fthe rain turning heavier at times
OL,16,Fovernight. Strengthening southerly
OL,17,Fwinds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
