OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FOutbreaks of occasionally
OL,6,Fheavy rain in the morning then dry for
OL,7,Fa time before further showers in the
OL,8,Fafternoon and evening. Fresh to strong
OL,9,Fsoutherly winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FBright
OL,12,Fstart Monday, then strong winds and
OL,13,Foccasionally heavy rain or showers
OL,14,Fdeveloping, this persisting through
OL,15,Fmuch of Tuesday. Strong winds easing
OL,16,Fearly Wednesday, dry with bright
OL,17,Fspells later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
